4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,060
Ettusen etthundratjugonio kronor.

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,060
Spara trehundrafyrtio kronor.

6
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,660
Tjugotre procent rabatt
